% Butler: Are you sure you want to eat this?
% Butler: Would you care for this, sir?
% Butler: Are you quite certain this is to your liking?
% Butler: You do know what you're getting yourself into, yes?
% Butler: Your wish is my command. Are you quite sure?
% Butler: Oh? You actually want this?
% Butler: May I take that as your final decision?
- Yes
	%5 Butler: Very well. [$> SignalBus.close_up_menu_closed.emit(true)]
	% Butler: Very well. I shall pretend not to be concerned. [$> SignalBus.close_up_menu_closed.emit(true)]
- No
	%5 Butler: Very well. [$> SignalBus.close_up_menu_closed.emit(false)]
	% Butler: Tis a shame. [$> SignalBus.close_up_menu_closed.emit(false)]